In the configured Spring project, what response follows GET /greeting?name=Ada?

Environment: Spring Initializr Maven project with Spring Web. Import org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.*; place the controller beneath the @SpringBootApplication package. Run ./mvnw spring-boot:run.

```java
// File: GreetingController.java in the generated Spring project package.
@RestController
class GreetingController {
  record Greeting(String message) {}
  @GetMapping("/greeting")
  Greeting greeting(@RequestParam(defaultValue = "Java") String name) {
    return new Greeting("Hello " + name);
  }
}
```
